  "content": "\n\n<p>Этот <strong>неофициальный</strong> пакет совместимости обеспечивает бесшовную интеграцию перечисленных ниже модов с великолепным <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur</a> ресурс-паком.</p>\n<h3><strong>Поддерживаемые моды:</strong></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-plaques\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Advancement Plaques</em></a> - (100%) <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Рекомендуется использовать 8-значный шестнадцатеричный код цвета #FF808080 для заголовков плашек (например, «Достижение разблокировано!»). Данная опция находится в конфигурации мода в разделе визуальных настроек.</span></p>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animal-feeding-trough\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Animal Feeding Trough</a></em> - (100%)</p>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-advancements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Advancements</a></em> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cherished-worlds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Cherished Worlds</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chunk-loaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Chunk Loaders</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corpse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Corpse</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Cosmetic Armor Reworked</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-cobblestone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Create Cobblestone</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slice-and-dice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Create Slice and Dice</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-synthetic-pressure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Create Synthethic Pressure</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decostorage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Decorative Storage</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Easy Anvils</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Easy Magic</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Villagers</a></em> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explorers-compass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Explorer's Compass</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fishermans-trap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Fishermen's Trap</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fungi-stew\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Fungi Stew</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-hopper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Golden Hopper</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/health-bars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Health Bars</a></em> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Horseman</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Immersive Enchanting</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Mystical Oak tree</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-compass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Nature's Compass</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Overflowing Bars</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pet-cemetery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Pet Cemetery</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polymorph\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Polymorph</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quality-equipment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Quality Equipment</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realistic-horse-genetics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Realistic Horse Genetics</em></a> - (5%, только незеритовая конская броня)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-netherite-horse-armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Simple Netherite Horse Armor</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Stylish Effects</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trade-cycling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Trade Cycling</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/warrior-rage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Warrior Rage</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-tome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>XP Tome</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-cave-biomes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Yung's Cave Biomes</em></a> - (100%)</p>\n<p><strong>Благодарности:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Maffhew – создатель <em>Excalibur</em></li>\n<li>Gray Scale – за текстуры для <em>Explorer's Compass</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/brass_mccrafty/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brass_McCrafty</a> – за текстуры для <em>XP Tome</em></li>\n<li>TimothyWiggins – за текстуры для <em>Nature's Compass</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/grandpappyjay/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GrandPappyJay</a> – за его старые текстуры для <em>Cherished Worlds</em> из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/clarent-excalibur-patch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Clarent</em></a> ресурс-пака</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lowpolycat/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">lowpolycat</a> – за то, что поручила мне поддержку нескольких модов, для которых она создала текстуры</li>\n<li>Meracle – за текстуры Better Advancements</li>\n<li>Также огромное спасибо каждому автору модов, включённых в этот список.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fexcal-additions-mod-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Modrinth</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Не стесняйтесь включать этот пакет в любые модпаки, просто обязательно укажите меня в списке благодарностей!</span> 🏰</p>",
